NC Recon reads public data from third parties (imagery, elevation, building
inventories, field records). Their licences and the attribution each needs are
listed in LICENSES.md; outputs that include OpenStreetMap data are subject to
the ODbL, and anything built on Maxar Open Data is non-commercial.

The general image damage model is the xView2 baseline classifier,
Copyright 2019 Carnegie Mellon University, BSD-3-Clause
(licenses/xview2-baseline-BSD-3.txt). It was trained on xBD, whose data terms
are non-commercial.

The self-check vocabulary and margin maths are adapted from Margin
(https://github.com/print-EddyMa/margin), Copyright 2026 Eddy Ma, MIT License
(licenses/margin-MIT.txt).
The evidence-traced brief and the NASA GIBS layer list are adapted from Canary
(https://github.com/print-EddyMa/Canary), by the same author.
